OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Frather cloudy for many, however, a
OL,7,Fslight frost may form under clear
OL,8,Fspells inland with mist and patchy fog
OL,9,Fdeveloping by dawn. Isolated light
OL,10,Fshowers developing along the coast
OL,11,Flater. Light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FMainly cloudy to start with
OL,14,Fa weakening band of showery rain moves
OL,15,Fslowly southwards through eastern
OL,16,Fparts during the day. Temperatures
OL,17,Fnear normal, colder by evening. Light
OL,18,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
